# --- local user images (privacy rule in docs/SECURITY-PRIVACY.md) ---
# `var/` is STORAGE_ROOT: uploaded garment photographs, private by default. It must never
# be committed, and it is not under a web root. `data/samples/` is the deliberate
# exception — a handful of photographs for the live suite, committed on purpose.
/storage/
/uploads/
var/
*.local.json

# --- local database (B12: no migrations yet, so create_all writes this file) ---
*.db
*.db-journal
*.sqlite3

